{"id":"80bd19d81f860e01","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-dlo-categoricity.md","title":"DLO is ω-Categorical","display":"thm-dlo-categoricity — DLO is ω-Categorical","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-dlo-categoricity","aliases":["57-thm-dlo-categoricity"],"display":"thm-dlo-categoricity — DLO is ω-Categorical","depends_on":["[[57-df-dlo]]","[[57-df-elementary-equivalence]]","[[57-df-isomorphism]]","[[57-df-total-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-dlo-categoricity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-dlo-categoricity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dlo-categoricity — DLO is ω-Categorical"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"59981a2d27254902\" href=\"?note=59981a2d27254902\" title=\"57-df-dlo\">57-df-dlo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"238427f0df2ecaed\" href=\"?note=238427f0df2ecaed\" title=\"57-df-elementary-equivalence\">57-df-elementary-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b82abcee4938fc49\" href=\"?note=b82abcee4938fc49\" title=\"57-df-isomorphism\">57-df-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1e5d7c3f7413640b\" href=\"?note=1e5d7c3f7413640b\" title=\"57-df-total-order\">57-df-total-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"DLO-is-$\\omega$-Categorical\">DLO is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-Categorical</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_&lt;\">\\(S_&lt;\\)</span> 为纯关系字母表：唯一非逻辑符号为二元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span>，没有常量及函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S_&lt;}\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S_&lt;}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=|\\mathfrak B|\">\\(B=|\\mathfrak B|\\)</span>；两结构的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> 解释均满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1e5d7c3f7413640b\" href=\"?note=1e5d7c3f7413640b\" title=\"57-df-total-order\">57-df-total-order</a> 的严格全序条件。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DLO}\">\\(\\mathrm{DLO}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NoEnd}\">\\(\\mathrm{NoEnd}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"59981a2d27254902\" href=\"?note=59981a2d27254902\" title=\"57-df-dlo\">57-df-dlo</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|=|B|=\\aleph_0\">\\(|A|=|B|=\\aleph_0\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong\">\\(\\cong\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b82abcee4938fc49\" href=\"?note=b82abcee4938fc49\" title=\"57-df-isomorphism\">57-df-isomorphism</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DLO}(\\mathfrak A)\\land\\mathrm{NoEnd}(\\mathfrak A)\\land\n\\mathrm{DLO}(\\mathfrak B)\\land\\mathrm{NoEnd}(\\mathfrak B)\\to\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DLO}(\\mathfrak A)\\land\\mathrm{NoEnd}(\\mathfrak A)\\land\n\\mathrm{DLO}(\\mathfrak B)\\land\\mathrm{NoEnd}(\\mathfrak B)\\to\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>DLO 的原密度谓词保持不变。可数稠密线性序的同构唯一性在这里还需要两边都无端点；载体与其基数分别记号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"DLO-is-$\\omega$-Categorical","text":"DLO is $\\omega$-Categorical","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-dlo","status":"resolved","id":"59981a2d27254902","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-dlo]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-elementary-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"238427f0df2ecaed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-elementary-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"b82abcee4938fc49","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-total-order","status":"resolved","id":"1e5d7c3f7413640b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-total-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-total-order","status":"resolved","id":"1e5d7c3f7413640b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S_<$ 为纯关系字母表：唯一非逻辑符号为二元 $<$，没有常量及函数。$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S_<}$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$，$B=|\\mathfrak B|$；两结构的 $<$ 解释均满足 [[57-df-total-order]] 的严格全序条件。$\\mathrm{DLO}$ 和 $\\mathrm{NoEnd}$ 取 [[57-df-dlo]]。$|A|=|B|=\\aleph_0$；$\\cong$ 取 [[57-df-isomorphism]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-dlo","status":"resolved","id":"59981a2d27254902","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S_<$ 为纯关系字母表：唯一非逻辑符号为二元 $<$，没有常量及函数。$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S_<}$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$，$B=|\\mathfrak B|$；两结构的 $<$ 解释均满足 [[57-df-total-order]] 的严格全序条件。$\\mathrm{DLO}$ 和 $\\mathrm{NoEnd}$ 取 [[57-df-dlo]]。$|A|=|B|=\\aleph_0$；$\\cong$ 取 [[57-df-isomorphism]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"b82abcee4938fc49","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[